    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that's just what people say to feel better. it doesn't change the fact that the social version of me is dead. i cant just \"reconnect\" when the bridges are burned and everyone has moved on to a version of life that doesnt include me. it feels like i'm just a ghost haunting a world i'm not allowed to be part of anymore.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
