      "content": "it's just so heavy. like, what's even the point of trying to find \"solid ground\" when the ground doesn't want me? if im already socially dead, why am i still stuck carrying around this body that's just a constant reminder of everything i lost? it feels like i'm just a glitch in the system that hasn't been patched out yet.",
